    "sections": {
        "description": "WENS Consult is a modern WordPress theme designed for consulting firms, business agencies, startups, and corporate service providers. Its clean and minimal layout helps businesses showcase their services, expertise, and projects effectively. As a child theme of WENS Haelo, it inherits powerful features and flexibility tailored for professional services. The theme includes essential sections like a Hero Banner with a call-to-action, Services Section, About Section, Projects Showcase, Testimonials, Blog, and Contact. This design allows businesses to present their offerings professionally. WENS Consult emphasizes a structured workflow—Discovery, Strategy, Design, and Development—which is ideal for consulting firms wanting to display their methodology clearly. The theme is fully responsive, SEO-friendly, and optimized for performance across all devices. With its customizable layout and business-focused features, WENS Consult is perfect for consultants, corporate agencies, marketing firms, IT consultants, financial advisors, and startups. It helps businesses build credibility, showcase services effectively, and generate leads with a modern design."
    },
